# Custom overrides. Keep these before the base domestic/foreign + ad rules.

# Cloudflare Tunnel for DSH remote: pin only the tunnel egress, never AUTO.
# cloudflared dials region1/2.v2.argotunnel.com:7844 (http2 = TCP), SNI cftunnel.com.
# AUTO's latency switch silently kills the HTTP/2 connection -> phone 1033.
PROCESS-NAME,cloudflared,DSH
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,argotunnel.com,DSH
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cftunnel.com,DSH
IP-CIDR,198.41.192.0/24,DSH,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,198.41.200.0/24,DSH,no-resolve
# Phone-side WebSocket entry for the same tunnel.
DOMAIN,dsh-wl.risk-os.app,DSH
# If DIRECT proves stable in testing, change the DSH policy above to DIRECT.
# Do not send all of cloudflare.com to DIRECT; only this tunnel block.

# Tailscale tailnet for the on-Mac DeepSeek Harness remote.
# iPhone Shadowrocket must hand MagicDNS and CGNAT to its Tailscale module.
# DIRECT or skip-proxy sends them out the normal proxy, where the name has
# no public address and Safari fails the TLS handshake. tailscale.com stays
# on the proxy so the Shanghai control plane can still connect.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ts.net,TAILSCALE
IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,TAILSCALE,no-resolve

# 网易 UU 远程：控制面、信令、串流、测速、统计及 macOS helper 全部直连。
PROCESS-NAME,UURemote,DIRECT
PROCESS-NAME,UURemoteService,DIRECT
PROCESS-NAME,UURemoteDaemon,DIRECT
PROCESS-NAME,UURemoteServer,DIRECT
PROCESS-NAME,UURemoteHelper,DIRECT
PROCESS-NAME,uuyc-cli,DIRECT
